<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>!!!SCRIPT IS FOR HYPIXEL FARM!!!
Its an script for a full lenght sugarcane farm.
You start at the upper left so that you start walking left. You need to be in an 90 degree walk to the right. the rest is complete automated.
I recommend building a stop so the script doesnt walk over the lane since the delay is off sometimes.
I recommend you to get "Rancher Boots" and cap your speed 180 its the fastest with almost no loss.
Have fun with automated Macro for hypixel sugarcane farm.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 22 s
KeyUp 7 1
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 440 ms
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 2 s
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 21 s
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 440 ms
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 1 52</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Minecraft</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>